      "content": "i know there are people to talk to, but it doesn't change anything. it doesn't bring him back. it just feels like i'm performing this version of life that doesn't even belong to me anymore. everything feels so hollow and pointless without him. it's like i'm just a ghost wandering through an empty house.",
